     There's[0m[2m an[0m[2m `await[0m[2m asyncio.sleep[0m[2m(0[0m[2m.01[0m[2m)` after[0m[2m checking[0m[2m `[0m[2mif[0m[2m job["[0m[2mstatus"][0m[2m == "[0m[2mpending"`[0m[2m but before[0m[2m setting `[0m[2mjob["[0m[2mstatus"][0m[2m = "[0m[2mprocessing"[0m[2m`. During[0m[2m that[0m[2m `[0m[2mawait`,[0m[2m other[0m[2m workers can[0m[2m also find[0m[2m the[0m[2m same job[0m[2m ([0m[2msince it[0m[2m still has[0m[2m status[0m[2m "pending[0m[2m") and[0m[2m pick it[0m[2m up.[0m[2m So[0m[2m multiple workers[0m[2m can dequeue[0m[2m the same[0m[2m job concurrently[0m[2m.
     
     The[0m[2m fix:[0m[2m remove the[0m[2m `async[0m[2mio[0m[2m.sleep([0m[2m0.[0m[2m01)`[0m[2m or move[0m[2m the[0m[2m status change[0m[2m before the[0m[2m sleep[0m[2m,[0m[2m or better[0m[2m yet,[0m[2m set[0m[2m status to[0m[2m "[0m[2mprocessing"[0m[2m atom[0m[2mically before[0m[2m yielding[0m[2m control[0m[2m.[0m[2m
     
     Actually[0m[2m, looking[0m[2m at it[0m[2m more carefully[0m[2m - the[0m[2m sleep[0m[2m is a[0m[2m simulated delay[0m[2m but[0m[2m the real[0m[2m bug[0m[2m is that[0m[2m the[0m[2m check[0m[2m-and[0m[2m-set is[0m[2m not atomic[0m[2m. Two[0m[2m workers can[0m[2m see[0m[2m `[0m[2mstatus[0m[2m == "[0m[2mpending"`[0m[2m for[0m[2m the same[0m[2m job before[0m[2m either[0m[2m sets[0m[2m it to[0m[2m "processing[0m[2m". The[0m[2m `[0m[2mawait`[0m[2m just[0m[2m makes it[0m[2m more likely[0m[2m but[0m[2m even[0m[2m without it[0m[2m, in[0m[2m true[0m[2m concurrency it[0m[2m could happen[0m[2m. But[0m[2m in asyncio[0m[2m with a[0m[2m single thread[0m[2m, without[0m[2m the await[0m[2m, it's[0m[2m less[0m[2m likely[0m[2m since[0m[2m it's[0m[2m cooperative[0m[2m multit[0m[2masking.[0m[2m
     
     Actually[0m[2m in[0m[2m asyncio[0m[2m,[0m[2m since[0m[2m it's single[0m[2m-threaded[0m[2m, if[0m[2m there's[0m[2m no `[0m[2mawait`[0m[2m between the[0m[2m check and[0m[2m the set[0m[2m, then[0m[2m yes[0m[2m, it's[0m[2m atomic from[0m[2m the perspective[0m[2m of other[0m[2m cor[0m[2moutines.[0m[2m The[0m[2m `await[0m[2m asyncio.sleep[0m[2m(0[0m[2m.01[0m[2m)` is[0m[2m what[0m[2m creates[0m[2m the vulnerability[0m[2m window[0m[2m.
     
