     **Fix[0m[2m 2[0m[2m - Van[0m[2mishing failures[0m[2m (`worker[0m[2m.py`)[0m[2m**:[0m[2m
     In[0m[2m the except[0m[2m block,[0m[2m call `[0m[2mqueue.fail[0m[2m()`[0m[2m:
     
     ```[0m[2mpython[0m[2m
     except Exception[0m[2m as e[0m[2m:[0m[2m
         print(f[0m[2m"[Worker[0m[2m {worker[0m[2m_id}][0m[2m job {[0m[2mjob['[0m[2mid']}[0m[2m failed:[0m[2m {e[0m[2m}")[0m[2m
